<text x="404.0" y="1195.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">module back (PCB side)</text>
<text x="1080.0" y="632.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16">BACK VIEW — housing + PCB screwed on (pad side, as installed viewed from below)</text>
