<circle cx="1030.4" cy="733.2" r="13.2" class="padu"/>
<text x="1030.4" y="756.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8.5" class="t2">J11-1</text>
<circle cx="1000.0" cy="763.6" r="13.2" class="padn"/>
<text x="1000.0" y="786.4" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8.5" class="t2">J11-4</text>
<circle cx="1030.4" cy="763.6" r="13.2" class="padu"/>
<text x="1030.4" y="786.4" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8.5" class="t2">J11-3</text>
<text x="1116.0" y="687.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="12">J4 mate (2.54 pitch)</text>
<text x="972.0" y="687.2" text-anchor="end" font-size="12">J11 mate</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="729.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">GOLD = USED (pin test 2026-08-18):</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="747.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">  J11-1/2/3 : VBAT in, 3.47-3.68 V — tie together</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="765.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">  J4-5 : GND (continuity confirmed)</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="783.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">GRAY = leave unconnected:</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="801.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">  J4-1/3/4 : 3.3 V pulled-up encoder lines</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="819.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">  J4-2, J4-6 : idle low</text>
<text x="1216.8" y="837.2" text-anchor="start" font-size="11">  J11-4 : floating ~0.33 V</text>
<circle cx="980.4" cy="830.0" r="13.2" class="body"/>
<circle cx="980.4" cy="830.0" r="4.2" class="hidden"/>
<circle cx="1179.6" cy="830.0" r="13.2" class="body"/>
<circle cx="1179.6" cy="830.0" r="4.2" class="hidden"/>
<text x="945.6" y="849.2" text-anchor="end" font-size="11">M2 screw (2 mm thread,</text>
<text x="945.6" y="864.8" text-anchor="end" font-size="11">holds PCB to housing)</text>
<line x1="949.2" y1="852.8" x2="969.6" y2="836.0" class="lead"/>
<text x="1080.0" y="702.8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10">Ø2.15 PCB holes over the OFFSET half posts (+1.0,+8.5) / (−7.5,−8.5) — board only fits one way</text>
<text x="1080.0" y="1016.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5">Pin roles CONFIRMED by pin test 2026-08-18 — still pending: sleep sweep + load test on J11 (see Pin Test Results)</text>
<text x="1080.0" y="1202.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16">BACK VIEW — housing only (PCB removed)</text>
